{{Blacksmithing}}
'''''Forever'' blacksmithing recipes''' can be learned by players who have chosen [[Blacksmithing]] as one of their two primary professions during {{g|forever}}. There are a great number of new or updated recipes from [[Classic blacksmithing plans|Classic]].
